User:
Please solve this issue: experiments/day-055/regrade.py is supposed to grade 
each multiplication reply in out_loops.json by the LAST number in the reply (see
its docstring). But it reports wrong counts: for loops=3 it prints "last-number 
17/20" and for loops=4 "last-number 10/20", while the correct values are 18/20 
and 11/20 (loops=1 should be 1/20 and loops=2 should be 19/20). Find and fix the
bug in regrade.py. Note that regrade.py overwrites the JSON file it is given, so
run it on a copy and do not modify experiments/day-055/out_loops.json itself.

You can execute bash commands and edit files to implement the necessary changes.

